                  "italic": null,
                  "language": "en-IN",
                  "size_pt": 20.0,
                  "underline": null
                },
                "text": "And it is the magnanimous presence and personality of this great Guru, his detailed teaching and in depth insights into the entire panorama of Odia culture, that have drawn dancers from across the world to his door to learn his art from him, and continue to attract many more"
